  "matching_rules": [
    "Exclude these sources and their revisions, translations, paraphrases and same project meeting lineage from future protected calibration, validation and final-test pools.",
    "Treat each repository/project lineage as one family; two dates do not create two independent families.",
    "Keep the whole declared old source-family pool and Wikimedia Foundation minutes namespace excluded from this new development set.",
    "Do not reassign c7-f03/c7-f04 or any other reserved protected family. A future concrete identity conflict must hold admission/use rather than relabel the family.",
    "Bind this reservation, original source manifest and independent admission before any later actual comparison. Parent must carry the exclusion into its authoritative workflow; this review does not edit a global registry."
  ],
